tem_assets/steam/apps/3664200/extras/8255e8e11c0c8dc0bba6524214ab22bd.webm?t=1772710919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664200/extras/8255e8e11c0c8dc0bba6524214ab22bd.mp4?t=1772710919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity System:</strong> More than hunger or thirst, your mind is your foremost need. Manage your brain chemical imbalances in one of the most complex sanity systems ever seen in survival games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Systemic Crafting:</strong> Experiment freely with ingredients to cook food, brew tea and synthesise drugs. From lethal failures to superhuman breakthroughs, every craft expands your mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contraption Building:</strong> Build machines, vehicles, and inventions from modular blocks. Your creativity determines your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trials:</strong> Scattered across the island, these corporate games test your resourcefulness. Conquer them using every tool at your disposal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automation:</strong> Set up bases connected with pipes and conveyors to automate tasks, leaving you free to focus on exploration and survival.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Unifiq Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664200/b97c59c7dc8fa7e5c873b0703e80b6136281c4d7/header.jpg?t=1772710919","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3664200/1800120129/4296840b7b02ababae71ae707aee854a8b58cdb1/1760520576/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761126391","dash_h26